{"absolutePath":"/workspace/owo/lat.md/architecture.md","content":"# Architecture\n\nowo is one Rust binary crate. Each command loads an identity folder into memory, works on files only, and prints text or a JSON envelope.\n\n## Modules\n\nEach module owns one job; `main.rs` parses arguments with clap and dispatches.\n\n- `config.rs` resolves root, identity, project and KB. See [[formats#Config resolution]].\n- `identity.rs` walks one identity folder and parses every Markdown file into an `Entry` with a `Kind` decided by its path.\n- `markdown.rs` splits frontmatter, reads `## ` sections, extracts wiki-links outside code, counts words.\n- `slug.rs` holds the one slug function.\n- `templates.rs` embeds every template with `include_str!` and fills `{{key}}` placeholders.\n- `create.rs` implements `owo new`; `add.rs` implements `owo add`.\n- `index.rs` generates `_index.md` files and `life/timeline.md`.\n- `state.rs` and `stamp.rs` hash files and maintain the three `state.json` files.\n- `lint.rs` runs the rules in [[lint]].\n- `find.rs` resolves names, shows sections, and lists backlinks, outlinks and orphans.\n- `status.rs` derives current state and the Now block; `context.rs` builds the tiered load set.\n- `search.rs` is the BM25 ranker; `review.rs` records finished reviews.\n- `find.rs` resolves names, shows sections, and lists backlinks, outlinks and orphans.\n- `status.rs` derives current state and the Now block; `context.rs` builds the tiered load set.\n- `search.rs` is the BM25 ranker; `review.rs` records finished reviews.\n- `output.rs` defines diagnostics, the envelope and exit codes.\n\n## Loading an identity\n\n`Identity::load` reads `identity.json`, then walks the folder in file-name order and parses each `.md` file once.\n\nPath decides the kind: `life/events/x.md` is an event, `life/locations/<slug>/overview.md` a location, any other file in that folder a location detail, `_index.md` and `life/timeline.md` are generated. Files outside the layout get `Kind::Unknown`, which lint reports.\n\n## Link resolution\n\nLinks resolve through one lowercase key map built from titles, aliases, file stems (folder name for `overview.md`), identity-relative paths and soul file names.\n\n`resolve_link` tries the raw lowercase target, then its slug. Generated files are left out of the map, so links always land on authored entries.\n","path":"architecture.md","projectPath":"lat.md/architecture.md","frontmatter":{},"sections":[{"id":"lat.md/architecture#Architecture","heading":"Architecture","depth":1,"file":"lat.md/architecture","filePath":"lat.md/architecture.md","children":[{"id":"lat.md/architecture#Architecture#Modules","heading":"Modules","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/architecture","filePath":"lat.md/architecture.md","children":[],"startLine":5,"endLine":25,"firstParagraph":"Each module owns one job; `main.rs` parses arguments with clap and dispatches.","githubSlug":"modules"},{"id":"lat.md/architecture#Architecture#Loading an identity","heading":"Loading an identity","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/architecture","filePath":"lat.md/architecture.md","children":[],"startLine":26,"endLine":31,"firstParagraph":"`Identity::load` reads `identity.json`, then walks the folder in file-name order and parses each `.md` file once.","githubSlug":"loading-an-identity"},{"id":"lat.md/architecture#Architecture#Link resolution","heading":"Link resolution","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/architecture","filePath":"lat.md/architecture.md","children":[],"startLine":32,"endLine":36,"firstParagraph":"Links resolve through one lowercase key map built from titles, aliases, file stems (folder name for `overview.md`), identity-relative paths and soul file names.","githubSlug":"link-resolution"}],"startLine":1,"endLine":4,"firstParagraph":"owo is one Rust binary crate. Each command loads an identity folder into memory, works on files only, and prints text or a JSON envelope.","githubSlug":"architecture"}],"headingTitles":["Architecture","Modules","Loading an identity","Link 